	<h3>Installation</h3>
	<ol>
	  <li class="vspace">Get the archive file <a href="pub/MaBoSS-1.0.tgz" class="clean-link">MaBoSS-1.0.tgz</a></li>
	  <li class="vspace">Untar the archive file as follows:<pre>tar xvfz MaBoSS-1.0.tgz</pre>
	    note that the <span class="tt">MaBoSS-1.0</span> subdirectory will be created
	  </li>
	  <li>Compile MaBoSS:
<pre>cd MaBoSS-1.0/src
make install</pre>
	  </li>
	  <li>The executable file will be located in <span class="tt">MaBoSS-1.0/pub</span> and is named MaBoSS:
<pre>cd MaBoSS-1/pub
./MaBoSS 
usage: ./MaBoSS [-version] -c CONF_FILES... -o OUTPUT BOOLEAN_NETWORK_FILE

./MaBoSS -version
MaBoSS version 1.0
</pre>
	  </li>
	  <li>You may now add the directory <span class="tt">MaBoSS-1/pub</tt> to your PATH.
	</ol>
